        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitie jomoro ma jowok Yuda to jobino Antiok to jocako fonjo jom'oyeyo ni, “Wikinyal limo both kwanyo woko ka withumere paka Cik pa Musa waco.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo kodi Barinaba jobedo gi piem mager tektek gi jo kwoŋ gime; gikenyo oridhi ni Paulo kodi Barinaba kodi joman ma Antiok jowokidhi Yerusalem jowoneni jomoor kodi jotel ma kitipin kwoŋ wac me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ooro jo, joluwo yu Fonisia kodi Samaria to jowaco rijo paka Jopath bende jowire bongi Were; wac me okelo kisangala madwoŋ ri jom'oyeyo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jotundo Yerusalem, kitipa pa jom'oyeyo kodi jomoor kodi jotel ma kitipin je jojolo jo maber, to jowaco rijo gimoro je ma Were otimo rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jom'oyeyo megi m'oyido jonitie i kweth pa Jofarisayo jocungo to jowaco ni, “Mitere wothum Jopath aka wowaci rijo mako Cik pa Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jomoor kodi jotel ma kitipin, joromo kanyacel paro kwoŋ wac me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.1+ACT.10.2+ACT.10.3+ACT.10.4+ACT.10.5+ACT.10.6+ACT.10.7+ACT.10.8+ACT.10.9+ACT.10.10+ACT.10.11+ACT.10.12+ACT.10.13+ACT.10.14+ACT.10.15+ACT.10.16+ACT.10.17+ACT.10.18+ACT.10.19+ACT.10.20+ACT.10.21+ACT.10.22+ACT.10.23+ACT.10.24+ACT.10.25+ACT.10.26+ACT.10.27+ACT.10.28+ACT.10.29+ACT.10.30+ACT.10.31+ACT.10.32+ACT.10.33+ACT.10.34+ACT.10.35+ACT.10.36+ACT.10.37+ACT.10.38+ACT.10.39+ACT.10.40+ACT.10.41+ACT.10.42+ACT.10.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 10:1-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen munyo piem okadho kamabor, Petero ocungo to waco ni, “Wutmera, wiŋeyo nike yucen koro Were oyeran i dier win fonjo Jopath Wac Manyen Maber, nike jowonyal winjo jowoyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 10:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Were, m'oŋeyo cuny ji, onyutho paka ojolo Jopath munyo bende omiyo jo Cuny Maleŋ, paka otimo gi wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go k'opoko wan gi jo; aka ocwako reco pajo cungo kwoŋ yeyo pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, raŋo ma wimito temo Were mawan munyo wiyimo ri jom'oyeyo okol i goki jo makada kwarere wan kosa wawegi wakinyali tiŋo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be! Kole wayeyo ni wabino limo both kwoŋ nema pa Rwoth Yesu, paka jo bende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jom'ocokere je joliŋ to jowinjo Barinaba kodi Paulo munyo jonuŋanuŋa ri ji gir'aura je kodi gigipiny ma kelo dhier ma Were otimo i dier Jopath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jocowo luwo, Yakobo oluwo malo ni, “Winjan win, wutmera! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon owok tito riwan paka Were okutho onyutho paka dewo kwoŋ Jopath munyo kwanyo i dier jo ji ma jowobedi apere won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole wac pa jotuci wac Were makere swa gi me. Paka ndiko waco ama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Am'omiyo aparo ni wakiripi cando Jopath ma jowire bongi Were; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16+EXO.34.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 34:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.6+LEV.18.7+LEV.18.8+LEV.18.9+LEV.18.10+LEV.18.11+LEV.18.12+LEV.18.13+LEV.18.14+LEV.18.15+LEV.18.16+LEV.18.17+LEV.18.18+LEV.18.19+LEV.18.20+LEV.18.21+LEV.18.22+LEV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 18:6-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10+LEV.17.11+LEV.17.12+LEV.17.13+LEV.17.14+LEV.17.15+LEV.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 17:10-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kucel waripo ndiko balwa ma cero jo lamo cal makicar kosa timo kidakana kosa camo gim'odey kosa remo moro je kosa cemo moro je ma k'olony ayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Cik pa Musa otiek kisoma hongo malac i kalamo pa Joyuda m'omore i Sabato je, aka wac pere ifonjo i tindi je.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balwa ri Jopath ma joyeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jomoor kodi jotel ma kitipin pa jom'oyeyo, kanyacel gi kitipa pa jom'oyeyo gipi joridho yero ji moro i kitipa gi dhiro jo Antiok kodi Paulo gi Barinaba. Joyero Yuda m'ilwoŋo ni Barsaba kodi Sila, j'ario ma jom'oyeyo jomiyo dwoŋ swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodhiro jono gi balwa me: “Wan jom'oyeyo jowot win, ma joman jomoor aka joman jotel ma kitipin pa jom'oyeyo, wadhiro moth ri jom'oyeyo ma Jopath ma Antiok kodi Siria kodi Silisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watieko winjo paka ji megi i kitipa mawan jobino koro to jokwinyo win gi luwo pajo ma to wakifonjo jo ni jowotimi ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo watieko romo kanyacel aka wajoje wayere yero jomikwenda moro to wadhiro jo riwin. Jobino kanyacel gi merin mawan Barinaba gi Paulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cwo ma jojala kwo pajo i tic ri Rwoth Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo wadhiro riwin Yuda kodi Sila, ma wegi jobino waco riwin gigipiny ma wandiko riwin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato oneno ri Cuny Maleŋ kodi wan ni ber wakiri watur win gi bieto kwanyo woko or me kende: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wicam gim'ocow gine jwogi; wikiri wicam remo; wikiri wicam le m'odey; aka kure win kwoŋ kite ma kidakana. Wibino timo maber ka wikure kwoŋ gigipiny me. Kutho win.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jooro jomikwenda no to jokidho Antiok, kama jocok'iye kitipa pa jom'oyeyo je to jomiyo jo balwa no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ji josoma balwa no, kisangala opoŋ i cuny jo ro mikwenda ma dwoko meni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda kodi Sila, m'onwaŋo bende jotuci wac Were, joluwo ma hongo malac kodi jom'oyeyo no munyo jomedo jo meni kendo jodwoko cuny jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jocowo hongo moro kenyo, jom'oyeyo josewila jo gi siem, to jogik bongi jomoor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[To Sila oridho paro ma doŋ kenyo].",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo kodi Barinaba jocowo hongo moro i Antiok kanyacel gi joman mathoth munyo jofonjo wac pa Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kodi Barinaba jopokere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen Paulo owaco ri Barinaba ni, “Weyi wagiki waliewi wutmin wan i tindi je ma watieko fonj'iye Wac pa Were, aka wanen paka jonitie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barinaba onwaŋo yenyo ni jowokadhi gi Yohana Mariko bende, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 13:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Paulo oparo ni jokiripi kadho gine, rupiri ndir ca go k'obedo gi jo kiri i gik tic pajo, to owire to weyo jo i Pamfilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobedo gi piem matek wegi kendi gin, to jopokere. Gikenyo Barinaba okwanyo Mariko to jocewere jocomo yu Sipuro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Paulo oyero Sila to jokadho kareno jom'oyeyo joketho go i kur ma nema pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oluwo yu Siria kodi Silisia, munyo jomedo kitipa pa jom'oyeyo meni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
